Description: Draw parallel off-axis eyes on explicitly enabled stereo drawables
 Preserve the centre camera, frustum and caller draw buffer after both eyes.
 PLIB_SSG_STEREO=ON enables this path; separation and convergence use scene units.
Forwarded: no

